{
  "id": "sound___doppler_effect",
  "title": "Sound - Doppler Effect",
  "description": "Calculate the observed frequency of sound due to relative motion between a source and a listener using the Doppler Effect formula.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Sound - Doppler Effect\n\nThe change in frequency of sound due to relative motion between a source and a listener is called the **Doppler Effect**.\n\nThe observed sound frequency for a listener can be expressed as:\n\n**fr = fs (c + vr) / (c + vs)**\n\nWhere:\n- **fr** = frequency observed by the receiver (Hz)\n- **fs** = frequency emitted from the source (Hz)\n- **c** = speed of sound (m/s)\n- **vr** = velocity of the receiver relative to the medium (m/s) - positive if moving towards the source\n- **vs** = velocity of the source relative to the medium (m/s) - positive if moving away from the receiver"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "fs",
          "label": "Source Frequency (fs)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1000,
          "unit": "Hz"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "label": "Speed of Sound (c)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 343,
          "unit": "m/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "vr",
          "label": "Receiver Velocity (vr)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "m/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "vs",
          "label": "Source Velocity (vs)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "m/s"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "fr",
          "label": "Observed Frequency (fr)",
          "formula": "inputs.fs * (inputs.c + inputs.vr) / (inputs.c + inputs.vs)",
          "unit": "Hz",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Source Frequency (Hz)",
        "Speed of Sound (m/s)",
        "Receiver Velocity (m/s)",
        "Source Velocity (m/s)",
        "Observed Frequency (Hz)"
      ],
